WEBVTT

00:08:58.523 --> 00:09:02.210
and half of them will be anxious about radiation

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:05.531
and half of them will ignore it.

00:09:05.531 --> 00:09:08.343
Now, psychoanalysts know very well

00:09:08.343 --> 00:09:10.818
that people surprisingly don't have

00:09:10.818 --> 00:09:12.607
passion for knowledge

00:09:12.607 --> 00:09:15.689
but passion for ignorance.

00:09:15.689 --> 00:09:17.174
Now, what does that mean?

00:09:17.174 --> 00:09:18.990
Let's say when we are facing

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.783
a life-threatening illness,

00:09:21.783 --> 00:09:24.989
a lot of people don't want to know that.

00:09:24.989 --> 00:09:28.387
They'd rather prefer denying the illness,

00:09:28.387 --> 00:09:31.661
which is why it's not so wise to inform them